WEBVTT

00:16.090 --> 00:19.360
All the unfair stuff that adults keep doing?

00:19.540 --> 00:19.580
PRESENTED BY DOUTEI SUBS

00:23.710 --> 00:26.330
"You better keep your promises!"

00:26.330 --> 00:28.580
Look who's talking!

00:30.360 --> 00:32.450
Live by what you preach.

00:33.540 --> 00:36.440
All those misplaced sympathies,

00:36.440 --> 00:38.970
nuh-uh, no way, I don't want.

00:38.970 --> 00:41.620
"I'm only saying this for your own sake!"

00:41.620 --> 00:43.680
I can smell the lie from here.

00:43.680 --> 00:46.520
When I hear your true desires,

00:46.520 --> 00:49.090
I dunno what I'll do from there.

00:49.090 --> 00:50.280
Should we do it?

00:50.280 --> 00:54.410
That's for me to decide.

00:54.410 --> 00:58.670
"If I spoil her, she'll just take advantage of it."

00:58.670 --> 01:04.120
You are so thickheaded, you'll never understand.

01:04.450 --> 01:08.770
If you truly care for me, it will surely lead to

01:08.770 --> 01:13.390
me becoming a more honest, gentle girl.

01:13.890 --> 01:18.470
And I hope you find me totally adorable.

01:18.910 --> 01:21.370
That I'll be.

01:21.370 --> 01:23.960
That's true.

01:23.960 --> 01:25.990
Naturally.

01:30.910 --> 01:34.070
Huh? I thought I had my homework printouts...

01:45.080 --> 01:46.460
Oh, here they are!

01:56.720 --> 02:01.680
10th Period

01:56.720 --> 02:01.680
KIND TO PEOPLE

01:59.090 --> 02:01.730
Kuro-chan! Are those new clothes?!

02:01.730 --> 02:02.870
Nuh-uh!

02:02.870 --> 02:04.470
I bought this a while back!

02:04.790 --> 02:07.770
But I forgot it was in the back of the closet!

02:07.770 --> 02:09.070
You look like a doll!

02:09.070 --> 02:10.480
Good morning!

02:11.510 --> 02:13.050
Sensei!

02:13.050 --> 02:13.980
Take a look!

02:14.650 --> 02:16.490
Oh, what's up?

02:16.490 --> 02:18.990
Look at Kuro-chan! Isn't she cute?

02:18.990 --> 02:20.130
Ohh!

02:20.130 --> 02:25.370
It's like someone took clothes off a French doll and put them on a Japanese doll!

02:28.430 --> 02:31.500
Or a nutcracker... doll.

02:31.850 --> 02:33.740
Sensei, are you okay?

02:34.000 --> 02:35.930
Don't rub it!

02:59.490 --> 03:00.390
Oh right.

03:00.390 --> 03:03.070
Usa, bring me a library card later on.

03:03.070 --> 03:04.110
Okay.

03:05.030 --> 03:06.750
You're going to the staff office?

03:06.750 --> 03:09.690
I'll come with you! I want to see Shiro-chan!

03:09.690 --> 03:10.710
"Shiro-chan"?

03:10.710 --> 03:12.590
Shirai-sensei!

03:13.460 --> 03:16.460
STAFF OFFICE

03:14.890 --> 03:19.530
The clothes a kid wears reflect the thinkings of the parents.

03:19.530 --> 03:20.790
The parents?

03:20.790 --> 03:21.720
Yeah.

03:21.720 --> 03:26.610
Like their style of living,
how they treat their kids,

03:26.610 --> 03:29.670
or what they want to see
happen to their kid.

03:29.670 --> 03:32.210
The real problem would
be the opposite case.

03:32.210 --> 03:32.730
Huh?

03:32.730 --> 03:36.230
Look out for kids who wear the same clothes day after day.

03:36.230 --> 03:38.490
Oh, I see...

03:40.670 --> 03:44.330
So you can know a parent by
how they dress their kids?

03:44.330 --> 03:46.090
Makes total sense.

03:46.810 --> 03:47.850
Sensei!

03:47.850 --> 03:48.740
Oh, there's Sensei!

03:49.120 --> 03:49.990
Bye-bye!

03:49.990 --> 03:50.930
Let's go!

03:50.930 --> 03:52.000
Oh, Sensei?

03:52.000 --> 03:52.850
Let's hurry!

03:52.850 --> 03:54.350
Hey, what should I do?

03:54.350 --> 03:56.650
I'm still fuzzy about a lot of things.

03:56.650 --> 03:59.210
Still, I think this job is...

04:00.410 --> 04:03.630
Sensei! Here's the library card!

04:03.630 --> 04:06.260
Oh, Usa. Thank y-

04:06.260 --> 04:07.260
Huh?

04:08.370 --> 04:09.770
Wrong answer!

04:10.330 --> 04:12.250
Kokonoe!

04:12.250 --> 04:14.020
We all switched clothes!

04:14.020 --> 04:16.430
Color me surprised!

04:16.430 --> 04:19.030
You sure can think up some
weird games to play.

04:22.090 --> 04:23.520
Sensei.

04:23.520 --> 04:26.030
You... You know what?

04:26.330 --> 04:27.030
Hmm?

04:27.510 --> 04:30.040
Sensei... I love you.

04:30.390 --> 04:31.040
Oh-

04:39.290 --> 04:41.490
Is that right?

04:41.490 --> 04:43.050
Thank you, Kokonoe.

04:43.490 --> 04:48.050
I gotta work extra hard since
all you kids adore me.

04:48.770 --> 04:50.650
That's not what I mean!

04:50.650 --> 04:52.560
That's not the type of love I mean!

04:52.560 --> 04:53.390
Eh?

04:56.060 --> 04:58.390
Hey, Kokonoe!

05:00.650 --> 05:02.810
What about the library card?

05:07.490 --> 05:12.080
Although a lot has happened, I feel that I've finally found my stride.

05:12.860 --> 05:18.300
I guess I should give some credit to my many run-ins with Kokonoe.

05:20.850 --> 05:21.800
No!

05:22.310 --> 05:25.050
That last one had nothing to
do with it! Nothing at all!

05:27.010 --> 05:29.050
Rin-chan's clothes!

05:29.050 --> 05:30.650
Kuro-chan, it's too tight!

05:30.650 --> 05:33.560
Ooh! Looking good!

05:33.560 --> 05:36.560
Mimi-chan, you're out of sight!

05:36.560 --> 05:41.510
I don't have my glasses on, so I
can't see well. Do I look weird?

05:42.610 --> 05:44.650
You're hot! Sizzling!

05:45.870 --> 05:47.950
Rin-chan, welcome back!

05:49.750 --> 05:50.890
What's wrong?

05:50.890 --> 05:57.640
Sensei pays attention to me...
only because I'm a kid.

05:57.640 --> 05:58.540
Huh?

06:02.430 --> 06:06.080
At the same time, Sensei
<i>doesn't</i> pay attention to me...

06:07.590 --> 06:09.200
only because I'm a kid.

06:12.250 --> 06:13.870
Rin-chan...

06:14.930 --> 06:15.850
Hah-hah!

06:16.810 --> 06:19.850
My eyes always tear up
when I put on glasses!

06:22.590 --> 06:25.370
Sensei was <i>soo</i> shocked!

06:25.370 --> 06:31.870
Hey, next time I should wear Kuro-chan's clothes, and then Mimi-chan can wear my clothes...

06:31.870 --> 06:37.750
And Kuro-chan will look all baggy in Mimi-chan's clothes!

06:35.210 --> 06:37.750
Hey, Rin-chan...

06:39.550 --> 06:40.670
Reiji...

06:42.950 --> 06:44.120
Reiji-san!

06:45.010 --> 06:46.330
Long day, huh?

06:46.330 --> 06:50.640
Oh, hello there, Kuro-chan. Mimi-chan.

06:51.130 --> 06:54.640
R-Reiji-san just... said my name!

06:55.730 --> 06:57.680
What's going on, Reiji?

06:57.680 --> 06:58.730
Right.

06:58.730 --> 07:00.140
I got done with work early.

07:00.760 --> 07:03.630
And I thought we could go out to eat this once.

07:05.470 --> 07:07.850
Oh, you don't really have to...

07:09.170 --> 07:11.110
Bye, girls.

07:11.110 --> 07:13.230
I'll see you guys tomorrow!

07:13.230 --> 07:13.910
Ah!

07:13.910 --> 07:16.390
Yeah... see you.

07:19.900 --> 07:20.720
"Mimi-chan?"

07:27.290 --> 07:30.390
We could have gone to a
ritzier restaurant, you know.

07:30.390 --> 07:32.930
It's fine! The food here is great!

07:33.510 --> 07:35.210
I'm sorry, Rin.

07:35.210 --> 07:36.270
Huh?

07:36.270 --> 07:39.180
I'm going to be very busy with work again.

07:39.180 --> 07:41.330
Plus I'll be coming in late.

07:42.070 --> 07:43.440
Reiji...

07:43.440 --> 07:47.070
I truly want to be there for you.

07:47.070 --> 07:48.490
It's okay!

07:49.210 --> 07:52.320
You're working hard just for me.

07:57.550 --> 08:01.090
May I collect your plates?

08:01.090 --> 08:02.890
Oh, certainly.

08:02.890 --> 08:04.710
Rin, do you want some dessert?

08:04.710 --> 08:06.110
Mm-hmm!

08:07.290 --> 08:09.570
I wonder what I should get?

08:09.570 --> 08:13.770
Right now we are giving children
free after-dinner soft serves.

08:15.220 --> 08:17.390
Isn't that great, Rin?

08:17.390 --> 08:18.310
Yeah...

08:21.010 --> 08:22.730
I guess I won't have any.

08:23.190 --> 08:25.230
I'm already full anyway.

08:26.970 --> 08:27.890
Rin?

08:30.450 --> 08:32.240
Hey, look up kids!

08:32.240 --> 08:33.910
It's starting to eclipse!

08:33.910 --> 08:35.590
Wow, cool!

08:35.590 --> 08:37.910
Aw, I can't see it!

08:39.230 --> 08:41.540
Hey, Rin-chan, I can see the top part getting...

08:42.910 --> 08:44.230
Rin-chan?

08:47.930 --> 08:48.990
Oh, sorry!

08:49.970 --> 08:50.570
She's bleeding!

08:50.570 --> 08:51.380
You all right?

08:53.070 --> 08:54.370
Who's the nurse's aide?

08:56.570 --> 08:57.890
I am.

08:59.810 --> 08:59.850
NURSE'S OFFICE

09:04.130 --> 09:06.060
Come on, let's see that leg.

09:13.830 --> 09:14.700
Lick it.

09:17.330 --> 09:20.700
Cuts like these will heal
faster if you lick them.

09:22.050 --> 09:24.370
Antiseptics are more proven.

09:25.130 --> 09:26.210
You're no fun.

09:28.510 --> 09:30.170
Okay...

09:30.170 --> 09:33.710
Next Sunday... can we go on a date?

09:34.050 --> 09:38.290
Okay... we're not talking about
your cuts anymore, are we?

09:39.130 --> 09:42.050
Are we going? Or are we not?

09:42.810 --> 09:46.350
Do you even know what to do on a date?

09:46.350 --> 09:47.980
You're just a kid.

09:49.110 --> 09:52.480
"Just... a kid..."

09:53.410 --> 09:56.070
If that's what you think, try pulling on that ribbon!

09:59.250 --> 09:59.990
What?

09:59.990 --> 10:02.370
Isn't that just part of your skirt...

10:06.450 --> 10:08.000
Sensei?

10:08.670 --> 10:11.000
Wh... Why do you have that underwear?

10:11.830 --> 10:13.890
Am I still "just a kid"?

10:16.590 --> 10:18.750
H-Hey, if someone comes in-

10:18.750 --> 10:20.010
Answer me!

10:21.070 --> 10:24.520
If you don't, I'll tell Reiji
you took off my panties!

10:26.830 --> 10:31.520
"The clothes a kid wears reflect
the thinkings of the parents."

10:31.520 --> 10:34.350
He'll come flying in to save me.

10:35.010 --> 10:37.430
He might even murder you.

10:43.350 --> 10:45.990
Her sexy, adult underwear...

10:47.110 --> 10:49.540
Her abnormally mature speech
patterns and behavior...

10:50.190 --> 10:52.270
The strange feeling I got seeing those two...

10:52.910 --> 10:57.490
Reiji-kun must love her a whole lot, so why is she so attached to me?

10:59.390 --> 11:00.340
Dear God!

11:01.010 --> 11:03.130
That guy sees Kononoe...

11:03.130 --> 11:05.690
not as a kid, but as a woman?

11:09.390 --> 11:11.230
Why are you averting your eyes?

11:11.980 --> 11:16.390
If you think I'm just a kid, then you should have no problem looking at me!

11:17.110 --> 11:19.240
That's not the problem here!

11:19.240 --> 11:21.670
Then why is your face so red?

11:23.800 --> 11:26.740
Why do my words trip you up?

11:26.740 --> 11:29.930
Why does your heart race when
you see my underwear?

11:33.230 --> 11:36.530
It's because... in reality...

11:37.370 --> 11:39.750
you think of me as a woman, don't you?

11:42.130 --> 11:43.350
Me?

11:45.760 --> 11:47.410
You're wrong!

11:47.410 --> 11:51.270
It's only because you say all those things kids shouldn't say!

11:51.680 --> 11:53.970
Anyone would be perturbed by that!

11:53.970 --> 11:55.270
That's all!

11:59.150 --> 12:00.330
Liar.

12:07.650 --> 12:10.290
Uh, excuse us!

12:10.630 --> 12:12.590
Oh there he is!

12:12.590 --> 12:13.790
Virgin-

12:13.790 --> 12:16.930
Don't call me that in the staff office!

12:18.210 --> 12:21.190
It's not like I'm saying
anything untrue, virgin.

12:22.390 --> 12:25.050
So what is it? You came
here for something, right?

12:25.050 --> 12:26.870
Uh, yes.

12:26.870 --> 12:28.930
It's about Rin-chan.

12:29.770 --> 12:30.830
About Kokonoe?

12:30.830 --> 12:34.170
For some reason, Rin-chan
has been feeling down lately.

12:34.170 --> 12:34.730
So we-

12:34.730 --> 12:37.190
You know what's up, don't you?

12:37.190 --> 12:40.820
Wh... Why would you think... <i>I</i> would know?

12:40.820 --> 12:43.130
But, Rin-chan is...

12:43.130 --> 12:45.770
Forget it, Mimi-chan.

12:45.770 --> 12:47.200
There's no point.

12:47.850 --> 12:51.710
A virgin wouldn't know anything about how a girl feels anyway.

12:54.570 --> 12:55.620
Hmm?

12:57.610 --> 13:00.090
Afternoon classes are starting.

13:00.090 --> 13:01.530
You need to hurry back.

13:01.530 --> 13:02.010
Huh?

13:02.320 --> 13:03.210
Hmph!

13:03.210 --> 13:04.670
Mimi-chan, let's go.

13:04.670 --> 13:07.410
B-But... but we...

13:07.410 --> 13:08.250
Hey!

13:08.250 --> 13:09.650
Quit dawdling!

13:11.750 --> 13:12.770
Mimi-chan?

13:14.110 --> 13:16.210
Just like Nakamura-sensei...

13:16.830 --> 13:18.110
Oh- Usa!

13:19.020 --> 13:20.020
Wai-

13:20.370 --> 13:23.360
You <i>really</i> disgust me, Aoki Daisuke!

13:27.710 --> 13:29.490
Aoki-sensei...

13:48.730 --> 13:49.250
Sorry!

13:49.250 --> 13:51.100
We'll see you again!

13:52.730 --> 13:55.030
They say this place is full too.

13:55.030 --> 13:56.100
Oh...

13:58.630 --> 13:59.870
In that case...

14:04.430 --> 14:05.910
Okay, cheers!

14:05.910 --> 14:08.030
Uh... cheers.

14:08.950 --> 14:10.930
Sorry...

14:10.930 --> 14:11.650
Hmm?

14:12.410 --> 14:15.040
For making you worry about me again.

14:15.610 --> 14:17.680
What are you saying?

14:17.680 --> 14:21.290
I just wanted to have a cold
one with someone, that's all!

14:22.130 --> 14:23.870
Houin-sensei...

14:26.750 --> 14:29.950
I've... gotten too ahead of myself.

14:29.950 --> 14:30.550
Eh?

14:30.790 --> 14:33.410
Usa has been so cheerful lately...

14:33.410 --> 14:37.470
I really thought she'd completely
gotten over her ordeal.

14:38.630 --> 14:40.090
Oh...

14:40.090 --> 14:41.890
Kokonoe's...

14:41.890 --> 14:46.450
I mean, I was going about like I fully understood all my students.

14:47.570 --> 14:51.670
If only it were that easy
to understand kids.

14:51.670 --> 14:52.670
But...

14:52.670 --> 14:54.330
Don't sweat it!

14:54.810 --> 14:58.330
You can only gain experience gradually.

14:58.890 --> 15:00.110
Experience...

15:02.470 --> 15:04.230
Experience.

15:04.230 --> 15:11.340
If only I had experience with women, I probably wouldn't be so bewildered by their antics.

15:13.330 --> 15:16.670
You're simply not adept enough.

15:16.670 --> 15:17.350
Huh?

15:18.190 --> 15:20.270
It makes me uneasy.

15:20.970 --> 15:25.470
Whenever I look at you... I feel uneasy.

15:25.470 --> 15:26.360
Uneasy?

15:26.890 --> 15:29.490
You're up-front and earnest
with just about everything.

15:30.110 --> 15:33.470
And I think, "Why can't he be better?"

15:33.470 --> 15:36.370
When I watch you, I get sort of frustrated...

15:36.830 --> 15:39.530
and sort of impatient...

15:39.530 --> 15:42.670
and sort of... excited.

15:45.490 --> 15:46.830
Houin-sensei...

15:48.290 --> 15:51.720
It makes me uneasy. It really does.

15:54.530 --> 15:58.570
If I had... any experience...

15:58.570 --> 16:00.030
with a woman...

16:06.480 --> 16:09.010
Oh, can you give me a sec?

16:09.010 --> 16:10.740
Oh, sure.

16:14.240 --> 16:15.240
INBOX

16:14.240 --> 16:15.240
I'M HOME RIGHT NOW.
HELP ME. REIJI IS

16:17.870 --> 16:18.870
What happened?

16:18.870 --> 16:21.500
S-Sorry, I...

16:22.310 --> 16:24.170
A-Aoki-sensei!

16:38.090 --> 16:40.270
Sensei! Come on in!

16:46.480 --> 16:47.980
It's this!

16:50.030 --> 16:53.490
Reiji's late coming home, and I couldn't open it.

16:55.490 --> 16:57.700
I wanna eat them right now.

16:57.700 --> 16:58.990
Can you help me?

17:04.690 --> 17:06.750
Are you... mad?

17:10.650 --> 17:12.380
In that case, as an apology...

17:13.270 --> 17:16.260
I just took a bath...

17:20.330 --> 17:21.790
Wait!

17:26.910 --> 17:30.770
You're just super-pissed that I barged in on your date with Houin-sensei!

17:30.770 --> 17:32.470
Am I right? Huh?

17:32.470 --> 17:34.030
Is that it?

17:34.570 --> 17:35.530
Sensei!

17:35.930 --> 17:38.070
Aren't you even going to yell at me?

17:47.130 --> 17:48.710
He came for me.

17:50.710 --> 17:53.230
He came... for me.

18:01.670 --> 18:03.870
Why couldn't I get angry?

18:09.230 --> 18:10.470
I was...

18:14.850 --> 18:16.410
Kokonoe...

18:18.070 --> 18:19.370
...scares me.

18:23.130 --> 18:25.500
Wow, what a spread!

18:26.410 --> 18:27.970
It's pickle udon!

18:27.970 --> 18:29.620
P... Pickles?

18:30.210 --> 18:33.130
I wanted to challenge myself!

18:34.330 --> 18:35.450
Ah...

18:35.450 --> 18:37.430
I forgot the dressing!

18:41.430 --> 18:42.640
Oh?

19:09.230 --> 19:13.170
Why did the old man thank Hiroko-san?

19:13.710 --> 19:15.670
Does anyone here know?

19:15.670 --> 19:17.520
Yes!

19:18.250 --> 19:20.050
Okay, then I'll pick...

19:24.670 --> 19:26.130
Okay, Henmi!

19:44.570 --> 19:45.990
What's wrong?

19:46.700 --> 19:49.090
Everyone has already left.

19:51.490 --> 19:52.430
Hmm?

19:53.950 --> 19:55.210
Tell me...

19:58.070 --> 20:02.710
How do I get someone to love me?

20:02.710 --> 20:04.720
Did you have a fight with a friend?

20:12.650 --> 20:13.730
It's simple.

20:14.370 --> 20:20.110
When you want to befriend someone, you must first be kind to that person.

20:21.090 --> 20:25.240
I must... be kind?

20:25.240 --> 20:26.870
That's right!

20:26.870 --> 20:29.810
Everybody likes to be treated kindly.

20:29.810 --> 20:33.030
And they in turn will like that person back.

20:33.030 --> 20:40.610
If everybody were kind to each other,
wars and such would come to an end.

20:40.610 --> 20:42.260
Mm-hmm! Oh?

20:42.810 --> 20:44.130
Thank you.

20:45.390 --> 20:48.260
Now I'm glad I didn't do it.

20:48.260 --> 20:49.260
Huh?

20:57.650 --> 21:00.820
Hell yeah! I also got what it takes!

21:00.820 --> 21:03.780
He's not gonna outstrip me!

21:03.780 --> 21:07.780
EVERYBODY GET ALONG

21:47.860 --> 21:49.940
I was tied by the rules crying my eyes out.

21:49.940 --> 21:52.520
Was I fed up so much I hit "C" and flew?

21:52.520 --> 21:54.950
If you wanna taste, go ahead and try it on the fly

21:54.950 --> 21:56.570
Heart racing, I get a flower on my test, smile and go

22:02.950 --> 22:05.520
Geh! No way! I'm not waiting ten years to LOVE LOVE!

22:05.520 --> 22:08.070
I can't resist, I've been dreaming of it ALL NIGHT.

22:08.070 --> 22:09.980
I will do what you say, MAYBE.

22:09.980 --> 22:13.150
For you, right now we'll have our WEDDING.

22:13.150 --> 22:15.670
Just tender kisses? NO NO! Adult thinking.

22:15.670 --> 22:18.220
We're taking it further and forceful - GO! IN!

22:18.220 --> 22:20.070
A HEART BEAT that is so loud.

22:20.070 --> 22:22.960
That's just how I do things, baby.

22:23.290 --> 22:28.560
Convey your feelings for me

22:28.560 --> 22:33.160
not with words, but through warm kisses.

22:33.160 --> 22:37.320
Let's turn our entire world

22:37.320 --> 22:43.290
upside down, right now.

22:44.010 --> 22:46.150
A girl's punch will get through, don't you think?

22:46.150 --> 22:48.760
Will the surprise be enough to attract you?

22:48.760 --> 22:51.220
A thought-over impulse is also great

22:51.220 --> 22:53.800
LUCKY I gobbled down your earlobe.

22:53.800 --> 22:56.290
Kiss! I was tied by the rules crying my eyes out.

22:56.290 --> 22:58.830
